      "entries": [
        "The uthul unleashes a powerful bolt of lightning and a stunning thunderclap. The bolt deals 6d12 electricity damage to all creatures in a 30-foot line, with a DC 34 basic Reflex save, and every creature in a 20-foot emanation must attempt a DC 34 Fortitude save. The uthul can't use Lightning Crash again for 1d4 rounds."
